 "remarks": "Welcome to 16 Rockmeadow, Unit C, an updated and inviting townhouse tucked away in the Rockmeadow community. Freshly painted and featuring two Bedrooms, one Full Bath and one Half Bath, this home offers comfortable living in a private setting. The kitchen features custom cherry cabinetry, quartz countertops and stainless steel appliances. Gorgeous new hardwood floors extend throughout the home, including the living and dining areas, where sliders connect the interior to a patio and newer AZEK decking-perfect for relaxing or enjoying your morning coffee. Upstairs, the generously sized Primary Bedroom offers a walk-in closet and sliders to a balcony at the front. The home also includes a one-car garage and an additional reserved parking space. An extra room off the garage can be used for storage, a work area or even a home gym. Set within a neighborhood of single-family homes, Rockmeadow offers open common areas, attractive stone landscaping, visitor parking, and convenient access to I-95, Route 7 and the Merritt Parkway. The association allows up to two dogs or cats!",
